  10. Minimal copy-list for a new project                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                           
  If you're porting this end-to-end, copy in this order:
                                                                                                                                                                           
  1. Server                                                   
    - packages/env/src/server.ts — add the 3 FIREBASE_* vars.                                                                                                              
    - packages/api/src/lib/firebase.ts (admin init).                                                                                                                       
    - packages/api/src/lib/push.ts (send + cleanup) — strip the quiet-hours / frequency-limit calls if you don't need them.                                                
    - Add firebase-admin to deps and externalize it from your bundler.                                                                                                     
  2. DB                                                                                                                                                                    
    - fcm_token table from packages/db/src/schema/notifications.ts.                                                                                                        
  3. API                                                                                                                                                                   
    - packages/validators/src/fcm-token.ts (Zod schemas).     
    - packages/api/src/routers/fcm-token.ts (router).                                                                                                                      
    - Mount it in your root router.                           
  4. Web                                                                                                                                                                   
    - packages/env/src/web.ts — add the 7 NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* vars.
    - apps/web-learner/src/lib/firebase.ts.                                                                                                                                
    - apps/web-learner/public/firebase-messaging-sw.js (verbatim, no bundling).
    - apps/web-learner/src/components/notification-setup.tsx — mount in root layout.                                                                                       
    - Add firebase to deps.                                   
  5. Mobile                                                                                                                                                                
    - apps/mobile/lib/notifications.ts.                       
    - PushNotificationSetup block from apps/mobile/app/_layout.tsx.                                                                                                        
    - expo-notifications, expo-device, @react-native-firebase/app to deps.                                                                                                 
    - google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist + Expo plugin config.                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                           
  That's the entire FCM surface — ~10 files plus DB schema, env, and the validator.  